OL,3,GNEWSAGivan calls for boycott of meeting
OL,4,Adue to 'unacceptable behaviour'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe education minister has told his
OL,7,Fofficials not to attend a Stormont
OL,8,Fcommittee due to what he called
OL,9,F"unacceptable behaviour" by a Sinn Fein
OL,10,Fassembly member (MLA).
OL,12,FIn a letter to the education committee
OL,13,FPaul Givan said that the vice-chair Pat
OL,14,FSheehan was "unable to refrain from
OL,15,Finappropriate treatment and questioning
OL,16,Fof departmental officials".
OL,18,FBut the committee chair, Alliance MLA
OL,19,FNick Mathison, called the minister's
OL,20,Fmove "unprecedented and unacceptable".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
